    Give SL retries the first-attempt budget and reserve Jev time
    
    Roy decided on 2026-10-18, after five F17 boss deaths whose Jev deadline
    fallbacks all occurred in SL retries, that retry turns get the same
    budget as the first attempt and that each fight allows four attempts
    instead of six. Each combat turn also reserves three seconds for Jev so
    simulation can no longer starve it. Only these plan hunks and the
    discussion addendum are committed.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Agent: claude-code@xdwin1

